oklinen.com/cdn/shop/files/all-sheets-compare-classic.jpg?v=1744138121&amp;width=352 352w, //www.brooklinen.com/cdn/shop/files/all-sheets-compare-classic.jpg?v=1744138121&amp;width=375 375w\" width=\"375\" height=\"375\" loading=\"eager\">\n                  </picture>\n              </div><div class=\"card--content\"><p class=\"t5\">Best for</p><p class=\"p5 card--subcopy\">If you ever run warm or live in a warmer climate</p></div><div class=\"card--content\"><p class=\"t5\">Just like</p><p class=\"p5 card--subcopy\">Your favorite button-down </p></div><div class=\"card--content\"><p class=\"t5\">Looks like</p><p class=\"p5 card--subcopy\">Matte with a casual, yet clean finish</p></div><div class=\"card--content\"><p class=\"t5\">Fabric content</p><p class=\"p5 card--subcopy\">100% Long-Staple Cotton Percale</p></div><div class=\"card--content\"><p class=\"t5\">Thread count (TC)</p><p class=\"p5 card--subcopy\">270 TC</p></div></div><div class=\"card__button\">\n                  <a href=\"/collections/classic-sheets\" data-ht-element=\"cta\" class=\"button button--secondary\">Shop Now</a>\n                </div></div>\n          </div><div class=\"splide__slide  \"\n              data-bg-color=\"magic-hour-light\" data-ht-element=\"compare-card\">\n              \n              <div class=\"compare__card card  five_props \">\n              <div class=\"card__wrapper\"><p class=\"t4 \">Washed Percale</p><p class=\"p5 card--copy\">Perfectly lived in, breathable</p><div class=\"card--image\">\n                  <picture>\n                    <img src=\"//www.brooklinen.com/cdn/shop/files/BKL_25-07_Bedding_WashedClassic_MistChambray_Texture_1x_WO_48x48_bb96cb8f-4610-40ce-bd92-0e639e4853d2.jpg?v=1757003164&amp;width=375\" alt=\"Compare Module Icon\" srcset=\"//www.brooklinen.com/cdn/shop/files/BKL_25-07_Bedding_WashedClassic_MistChambray_Texture_1x_WO_48x48_bb96cb8f-4610-40ce-bd92-0e639e4853d2.jpg?v=1757003164&amp;width=352 352w, //www.brooklinen.com/cdn/shop/files/BKL